  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "Why is a wind-turbine maker building",
      "start": 0.19,
      "end": 3.16,
      "shot": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "an AI data centre?",
      "start": 3.16,
      "end": 5.08,
      "shot": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "In Inner Mongolia, Envision is connecting",
      "start": 5.18,
      "end": 7.8,
      "shot": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "those businesses through an AI campus",
      "start": 7.8,
      "end": 9.8,
      "shot": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "called Galaxy.",
      "start": 9.8,
      "end": 11.08,
      "shot": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Follow the electricity to understand why",
      "start": 11.19,
      "end": 13.7,
      "shot": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "an energy company wants to build",
      "start": 13.7,
      "end": 15.78,
      "shot": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "it.",
      "start": 15.78,
      "end": 16.08,
      "shot": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Envision founder and CEO Lei Zhang",
      "start": 16.18,
      "end": 18.55,
      "shot": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "started the company in 2007, making",
      "start": 18.55,
      "end": 21.83,
      "shot": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "wind turbines.",
      "start": 21.83,
      "end": 23,
      "shot": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "It expanded into batteries and energy",
      "start": 23,
      "end": 25.26,
      "shot": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "systems.",
      "start": 25.26,
      "end": 26.08,
      "shot": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Computing creates demand for that equipment.",
      "start": 26.19,
      "end": 29.08,
      "shot": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Ulanqab sits about 300 kilometres northwest",
      "start": 29.08,
      "end": 32.04,
      "shot": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "of Beijing, in China's Inner Mongolia.",
      "start": 32.04,
      "end": 35.08,
      "shot": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "SemiAnalysis visited in September 2026.",
      "start": 35.19,
      "end": 39.02,
      "shot": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Its report is the starting point",
      "start": 39.02,
      "end": 40.33,
      "shot": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "for this story.",
      "start": 40.33,
      "end": 41.08,
      "shot": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "OpenAI's Stargate is the American comparison.",
      "start": 41.19,
      "end": 45.01,
      "shot": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "Galaxy is a separate Envision project.",
      "start": 45.01,
      "end": 48.08,
      "shot": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "SemiAnalysis reports 120 megawatts delivered in",
      "start": 48.19,
      "end": 51.28,
      "shot": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "August 2026, within a year.",
      "start": 51.28,
      "end": 54.08,
      "shot": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "That's power for computing equipment.",
      "start": 54.19,
      "end": 57.08,
      "shot": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "Megawatts measure the rate of electricity",
      "start": 57.19,
      "end": 59.89,
      "shot": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "use, not AI performance.",
      "start": 59.99,
      "end": 62.08,
      "shot": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "The full plan is 800 megawatts.",
      "start": 62.19,
      "end": 65.08,
      "shot": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Used continuously, that matches the annual",
      "start": 65.19,
      "end": 67.55,
      "shot": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "grid electricity bought by about 650,000",
      "start": 67.55,
      "end": 71.36,
      "shot": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "US homes.",
      "start": 71.36,
      "end": 72,
      "shot": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "Or about 67 stadiums like Munich's",
      "start": 72,
      "end": 74.89,
      "shot": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "Allianz Arena, comparing their maximum available",
      "start": 74.99,
      "end": 78.53,
      "shot": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "electrical power.",
      "start": 78.84,
      "end": 80.08,
      "shot": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "For AI, imagine eight centres using",
      "start": 80.19,
      "end": 82.5,
      "shot": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "100 megawatts for computing each.",
      "start": 82.5,
      "end": 85.08,
      "shot": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "Cooling needs extra power.",
      "start": 85.19,
      "end": 87,
      "shot": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "These are comparisons, not measured usage.",
      "start": 87,
      "end": 90.08,
      "shot": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "Accelerators process data, with memory and",
      "start": 90.19,
      "end": 93.31,
      "shot": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "networks keeping them supplied.",
      "start": 93.31,
      "end": 96.08,
      "shot": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "Power must reach those racks reliably.",
      "start": 96.19,
      "end": 98,
      "shot": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "Their heat also has to leave",
      "start": 98,
      "end": 99.85,
      "shot": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "the building.",
      "start": 99.85,
      "end": 101.08,
      "shot": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "SemiAnalysis describes a five-megawatt pilot testing",
      "start": 101.19,
      "end": 104.16,
      "shot": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "a different way of supplying the",
      "start": 104.16,
      "end": 106.33,
      "shot": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "racks.",
      "start": 106.33,
      "end": 107.08,
      "shot": 16
    },
    {
      "text": "Solid-state transformers convert incoming alternating current",
      "start": 107.19,
      "end": 111.09,
      "shot": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "into an 800-volt direct-current bus.",
      "start": 111.09,
      "end": 114,
      "shot": 17
    },
    {
      "text": "At the same power, doubling DC",
      "start": 114,
      "end": 116,
      "shot": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "voltage halves the current in a",
      "start": 116,
      "end": 117.98,
      "shot": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "conductor.",
      "start": 117.98,
      "end": 119,
      "shot": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "At the same resistance, lower current",
      "start": 119,
      "end": 121.33,
      "shot": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "reduces heating losses.",
      "start": 121.33,
      "end": 123.06,
      "shot": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Galaxy's actual savings need measuring.",
      "start": 123.19,
      "end": 126.08,
      "shot": 19
    },
    {
      "text": "Rack electronics still reduce voltage further",
      "start": 126.19,
      "end": 128.77,
      "shot": 20
    },
    {
      "text": "before that power reaches the chips.",
      "start": 128.77,
      "end": 131.08,
      "shot": 20
    },
    {
      "text": "Envision also makes turbines and batteries,",
      "start": 131.14,
      "end": 133.89000000000001,
      "shot": 21
    },
    {
      "text": "extending its role beyond owning the",
      "start": 133.99,
      "end": 136.19000000000003,
      "shot": 21
    },
    {
      "text": "building.",
      "start": 136.33,
      "end": 137.08,
      "shot": 21
    },
    {
      "text": "The company can coordinate generation, storage",
      "start": 137.19,
      "end": 140.38,
      "shot": 22
    },
    {
      "text": "and equipment supplying power inside the",
      "start": 140.38,
      "end": 143.2,
      "shot": 22
    },
    {
      "text": "campus.",
      "start": 143.2,
      "end": 144.08,
      "shot": 22
    },
    {
      "text": "But a wind farm's rated power",
      "start": 144.19,
      "end": 145.75,
      "shot": 23
    },
    {
      "text": "is not its output at every",
      "start": 145.75,
      "end": 147.28,
      "shot": 23
    },
    {
      "text": "moment.",
      "start": 147.28,
      "end": 148.06,
      "shot": 23
    },
    {
      "text": "The wind rises and falls.",
      "start": 148.19,
      "end": 150,
      "shot": 24
    },
    {
      "text": "Computing equipment needs reliable power through",
      "start": 150,
      "end": 152.93,
      "shot": 24
    },
    {
      "text": "those changes.",
      "start": 152.93,
      "end": 154.07,
      "shot": 24
    },
    {
      "text": "Batteries store some surplus electricity and",
      "start": 154.07,
      "end": 156.89000000000001,
      "shot": 25
    },
    {
      "text": "supply it when generation falls below",
      "start": 156.99,
      "end": 159.33,
      "shot": 25
    },
    {
      "text": "demand.",
      "start": 159.33,
      "end": 160.08,
      "shot": 25
    },
    {
      "text": "Their usefulness depends on power, stored",
      "start": 160.19,
      "end": 163.23,
      "shot": 26
    },
    {
      "text": "energy, and how long the calm",
      "start": 163.23,
      "end": 165.33,
      "shot": 26
    },
    {
      "text": "lasts.",
      "start": 165.33,
      "end": 166.08,
      "shot": 26
    },
    {
      "text": "'Wind-powered' does not establish that wind",
      "start": 166.19,
      "end": 168.44,
      "shot": 27
    },
    {
      "text": "supplies all the electricity, every hour.",
      "start": 168.44,
      "end": 171.08,
      "shot": 27
    },
    {
      "text": "How much of Galaxy is fitted",
      "start": 171.18,
      "end": 172.55,
      "shot": 28
    },
    {
      "text": "with hardware and actually running remains",
      "start": 172.55,
      "end": 175.04,
      "shot": 28
    },
    {
      "text": "unverified.",
      "start": 175.04,
      "end": 176.08,
      "shot": 28
    },
    {
      "text": "Reported delivered capacity is not a",
      "start": 176.19,
      "end": 178.55,
      "shot": 29
    },
    {
      "text": "measurement of load drawn by working",
      "start": 178.55,
      "end": 181.17000000000002,
      "shot": 29
    },
    {
      "text": "servers.",
      "start": 181.33,
      "end": 182.08,
      "shot": 29
    },
    {
      "text": "Buildings and megawatts cannot confirm installed",
      "start": 182.19,
      "end": 184.63,
      "shot": 30
    },
    {
      "text": "chips, or how much work they",
      "start": 184.63,
      "end": 186.2,
      "shot": 30
    },
    {
      "text": "produce.",
      "start": 186.2,
      "end": 187.08,
      "shot": 30
    },
    {
      "text": "Envision's larger capacity announcements also need",
      "start": 187.14,
      "end": 190.17,
      "shot": 31
    },
    {
      "text": "reconciling with SemiAnalysis's description of the",
      "start": 190.17,
      "end": 193.26,
      "shot": 31
    },
    {
      "text": "campus.",
      "start": 193.26,
      "end": 194.08,
      "shot": 31
    },
    {
      "text": "Those are questions for Zhang and",
      "start": 194.19,
      "end": 195.77,
      "shot": 32
    },
    {
      "text": "the site's engineers, alongside the wider",
      "start": 195.77,
      "end": 198.19,
      "shot": 32
    },
    {
      "text": "strategy.",
      "start": 198.19,
      "end": 199.08,
      "shot": 32
    },
    {
      "text": "The next test is how much",
      "start": 199.19,
      "end": 200.54,
      "shot": 33
    },
    {
      "text": "useful computing this energy system can",
      "start": 200.54,
      "end": 203.15,
      "shot": 33
    },
    {
      "text": "deliver.",
      "start": 203.15,
      "end": 203.32,
      "shot": 33
    }
  ],
